01:02:00,000 --> 01:02:06,000
After Everything is a 2023 American romantic drama film written and directed by Castille
Landon, based on the characters from the After series of novels by Anna Todd.

11
01:08:12,000 --> 01:08:18,000
The direct sequel to After Ever Happy (2022) and the fifth installment the After film series, it stars Josephine
Langford and Hero Fiennes Tiffin reprising their roles as Tessa Young and Hardin Scott, respectively.

12
01:14:24,000 --> 01:14:30,000
The film was released in select theaters in the United States
on September 13, 2023, by Voltage Pictures.

13
01:20:36,000 --> 01:20:42,000
The film explores themes of alcohol, forgiveness,
lisbon, portugal, trauma, writer's block.

14
01:26:48,000 --> 01:26:54,000
The tone is lighthearted and emotional.
